  "state_owner": "Native RandomTile selects one of two designs. RandomColors sets glyph ColorString independently; tile primary remains declared w, detail one of m/W/r/R/b/B/g/G. Preserve captured/runtime values; no authored animation/palette timer.",
  "reverse": "Unpainted linen/stretcher/rear brace, authored unseen structure; source front motif never mirrored onto reverse.",
  "non_applicable": "Equipment/clothing assembly is not applicable to Painting; no inventory outfit or fabricated body fit.",
  "native_activation": false,
  "native_acceptance": "Pending integrated Stage3 after every pending entry is generated: exact tile choice, runtime palette, visibility and cell mapping. Only current bound fixed map view is a binding candidate; other furniture views are unbound authoring.",
